### COMMS

**[HB-01] Email urgency scan**
```
Spawn subagent: scan Gmail inbox for messages with urgency signals (subject contains
"urgent", "ASAP", "time-sensitive", "deadline", "action required", sender is known client).
Eval: any matching message flagged in last 30 min?
If yes: send Telegram "📧 Urgent email from {sender}: {subject}" with link.
State: track message IDs to avoid duplicate alerts.
```

**[HB-02] DM flag**
```
Spawn subagent: check Telegram/Discord DMs for unread messages older than 2h that
haven't received a reply. Look for messages with "?" or names in @-mentions.
Eval: unread DM older than 2h AND no reply sent?
If yes: send Telegram "💬 Unread DM from {sender} (2h+): {preview}"
State: track last-checked timestamps per channel.
```

**[HB-03] Social mentions**
```
Spawn subagent: search Twitter/X, Reddit, LinkedIn for mentions of {brand_name}
or {client_handle} posted in the last 4h. Exclude retweets of own content.
Eval: sentiment negative OR high engagement (>50 likes/comments)?
If yes: send Telegram "📣 Mention: {platform} — {preview}" with link.
State: store seen post IDs.
```

**[HB-04] Slack/Discord digest**
```
Spawn subagent: pull last 50 messages from {priority_channels} list.
Summarize into 3 bullets: decisions made, action items, blockers raised.
Eval: any new action item with @{client_name} or any blocker unresolved >4h?
If yes: send Telegram "📋 Channel digest: {summary_bullets}"
Run: every 4h during working hours.
```

