### CALENDAR / PRODUCTIVITY

**[HB-13] Conflict detection**
```
Spawn subagent: fetch today's calendar events via Google Calendar API.
Detect overlapping events (start time of event B < end time of event A).
Eval: any overlap found in next 4h?
If yes: send Telegram "⚠️ Calendar conflict: {event_a} overlaps {event_b} at {time}"
Run: once at 7am local, then every 2h until 6pm.
```

**[HB-14] Deadline approach**
```
Spawn subagent: read workspace/state/deadlines.json (maintained by agent).
Check for items with due_date within next {warning_hours} hours (default: 48h).
Eval: any deadline within warning window not yet marked complete?
If yes: send Telegram "⏰ Deadline in {hours}h: {task_name} — {notes}"
Run: every 4h.
```

**[HB-15] Stale tasks**
```
Spawn subagent: query {task_tool} (Linear/Notion/Todoist) for tasks assigned to
{client_name} last updated > {staleness_days} days ago (default: 5d).
Eval: any stale tasks in active sprint or high priority?
If yes: send Telegram "📋 {count} stale tasks (>{staleness_days}d): {top_3_titles}"
Run: daily at 9am local.
```

