### CONTENT

**[HB-16] Queue status**
```
Spawn subagent: check {content_scheduler} (Buffer/Hypefury/later.com) API for
scheduled posts in next 24h. Flag if queue empty or any post missing required fields.
Eval: queue empty for next 24h OR post flagged with missing media/caption?
If yes: send Telegram "📭 Content queue low: {details}"
Run: daily at 8am local.
```

**[HB-17] Engagement summary**
```
Spawn subagent: fetch last 7 days engagement metrics from {platform_apis}
(impressions, likes, comments, shares, follower delta).
Compare to prior 7-day window. Compute % change per metric.
Eval: any metric down >20% week-over-week?
If yes: send Telegram "📊 Engagement drop: {metric} -{pct}% WoW"
Run: weekly, Monday 7am local.
```

**[HB-18] Publish reminder**
```
Spawn subagent: check if any piece in {content_calendar} (workspace/state/content_calendar.json)
is marked "ready" AND scheduled date = today AND not yet published.
Eval: ready content past its scheduled publish time?
If yes: send Telegram "📢 Publish reminder: '{title}' scheduled for {time} — ready to go"
Run: check at 9am and 12pm local.
```

