### SECURITY

**[HB-19] Login alerts**
```
Spawn subagent: query {auth_provider} (Auth0/Supabase/AWS Cognito) for login
events in last 1h. Flag logins from new IPs or countries not in allowlist.
Eval: login from unknown IP or country?
If yes: send Telegram "🔐 Login alert: {email} from {ip} ({country}) at {time}"
State: maintain ip_allowlist.json in workspace/state/.
```

**[HB-20] Cert expiry**
```
Spawn subagent: check TLS certificate expiry for {monitored_domains} using
openssl s_client or a cert API. Alert at 30d, 14d, 7d thresholds.
Eval: any cert expiring within {days_threshold}?
If yes: send Telegram "🔒 Cert expiring in {days}d: {domain} (expires {date})"
Run: daily.
```

**[HB-21] Unusual API activity**
```
Spawn subagent: check API usage dashboards for {api_keys_to_monitor} (OpenRouter,
Anthropic, OpenAI, Stripe). Alert if spend in last hour > {hourly_spend_cap}.
Eval: hourly spend > cap OR usage > 2x prior-hour average?
If yes: send Telegram "⚠️ Unusual API spend: {provider} ${amount}/hr (cap: ${cap})"
Run: every 30 min.
```

