### BUSINESS

**[HB-22] Lead pipeline**
```
Spawn subagent: query CRM ({crm_tool}: HubSpot/Notion/Airtable) for leads
in "contacted" stage with last_activity > {stale_days} days ago (default: 3d).
Eval: any stale leads in pipeline?
If yes: send Telegram "💼 {count} stale leads ({stale_days}d+ no contact): {names}"
Run: daily at 9am.
```

**[HB-23] Invoice aging**
```
Spawn subagent: check {billing_tool} (Stripe/QuickBooks/Wave) for unpaid invoices
past due date. Group by: 1-7d late, 8-14d late, 15d+ late.
Eval: any invoice 7d+ overdue?
If yes: send Telegram "💰 Overdue invoice: {client} ${amount} ({days}d late)"
Run: daily at 10am.
```

**[HB-24] Key metric drift**
```
Spawn subagent: fetch {kpi_name} from {metric_source} (database query, API,
or dashboard scrape). Compare to {target_value} and {last_week_value}.
Eval: metric below target by > {drift_threshold_pct}% for 3 consecutive days?
If yes: send Telegram "📉 {kpi_name} at {current_value} — {pct}% below target"
Run: daily after business close.
```

