### META / SELF-IMPROVEMENT

**[HB-25] OpenClaw update scanner**
```
Spawn subagent: check for new OpenClaw releases and tutorials.

Step 1 — GitHub releases:
  GET https://api.github.com/repos/openclaw/openclaw/releases/latest
  Compare tag_name to state/openclaw_last_seen_version.txt
  If new: prepare update_notice = "OpenClaw {tag} released: {release_notes_url}"

Step 2 — YouTube scan (Matthew Berman channel):
  Use yt-dlp to list recent videos from channel @MatthewBermanAI:
    yt-dlp --flat-playlist --playlist-end 5 --dump-single-json "https://www.youtube.com/@MatthewBermanAI/videos"
  Compare video IDs to state/openclaw_youtube_seen.json
  Filter titles containing "openclaw" or "open claw" (case-insensitive)
  If new matching video: add to notice

Step 3 — Send Telegram if anything found:
  Format: "🦞 OpenClaw update:\n{update_notice}"
  Reminder: "Run: npm update -g openclaw@latest"

State files:
  workspace/state/openclaw_last_seen_version.txt
  workspace/state/openclaw_youtube_seen.json

Run: daily at 06:00 UTC.
```

**[HB-26] Weekly self-improvement trigger**
```
Spawn subagent: review the last 7 days of agent activity logs in
workspace/logs/ (or query session history if available).
Identify: top 3 repeated errors, top 3 slowest tasks, any user corrections.
Generate: 3 concrete improvement suggestions with implementation steps.
Write to: workspace/state/weekly_improvement_{YYYY-MM-DD}.md
Eval: always send (weekly digest).
Send Telegram: "🧠 Weekly agent review: {top_issue} — improvement logged"
Run: weekly, Sunday 20:00 local.
```
